        89
      ],
      "observation": "The red warning is a generic wolf actor-origin disc; it does not explain the visible mouth path, charge lane or separate pending bite phase.",
      "opinion": "Show a committed charge lane or local mouth-phase footprint that agrees with the actual contact geometry, then clear each resolved phase immediately. The indicator should help the player predict where a dodge is safe.",
      "qualification": "The origin was verified by root from the full27-second frame and code. Earlier low-resolution appearance as a player-origin ring was corrected."
    },
    {
      "timestampsSeconds": [
        20,
        21,
        22,
        23,
        51,
        52,
        53,
        54,
        55
      ],
      "observation": "Repeated stamina warnings cover the central combat area while the player repeatedly tries actions.",
      "opinion": "A persistent disabled/cost state on the action button and a less repetitive warning could clarify that an input was rejected before any attack. This would separate resource failure from a genuine collision miss.",
      "qualification": "Stamina rejection may explain some apparent failed inputs. It does not explain all visible misses, and no stamina balance/input change is proposed here."
    },
    {
      "timestampsSeconds": [
