        74
      ],
      "observation": "During close front-facing combat, the small warrior is often partly hidden beneath the much larger wolf's muzzle and forequarters.",
      "opinion": "Review camera elevation/near-fight framing or a subtle player visibility cue. The approved model scale should stay fixed; better visibility would help distinguish a real fall, guard, shove and prone maul.",
      "qualification": "This is a readability opinion from the supplied camera view, not evidence that model scaling or animation is incorrect."
    },
    {
      "timestampsSeconds": [
        16,
