      ],
      "observation": "Healing ticks and several damage numbers appear close to the same character overlap.",
      "opinion": "Clearer ownership/placement of hit, block and healing feedback could reduce uncertainty about which action connected. Keep healing/combat balance separate from any cosmetic presentation decision.",
      "qualification": "The sheets establish visual clutter but do not identify every individual damage/heal event."
    },
    {
      "timestampsSeconds": [
        60,
